WEBVTT

00:46:29.482 --> 00:46:33.396
Is it that they have been
absolutely disciplined

00:46:33.420 --> 00:46:37.507
about shutting down travel
from the infected regions

00:46:37.531 --> 00:46:43.335
and somehow really dialed up,
massively dialed up

00:46:43.359 --> 00:46:46.363
testing at any sign of any problem,

00:46:46.387 --> 00:46:50.065
so that literally, they are back
in containment mode

00:46:50.089 --> 00:46:52.272
in most parts of China?

00:46:52.296 --> 00:46:55.623
I can't get my head around it,
help me understand it.

00:46:55.647 --> 00:46:58.197
AK: So we estimated,
in the last two weeks of January,

00:46:58.221 --> 00:46:59.585
when these measures went in,

00:46:59.609 --> 00:47:02.014
the reproduction number
went from about 2.4 to 1.1.